1
00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:09,065
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,385 --> 00:01:42,905
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
<i>‎QUEEN CHU</i>‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

3
00:02:03,625 --> 00:02:05,225
LUOCHENG

4
00:02:05,305 --> 00:02:07,225
PRUDENCE AND PERSISTENCE

5
00:02:08,584 --> 00:02:11,185
Your Highness, Luocheng is less
than a hundred li from the Capital.

6
00:02:11,825 --> 00:02:14,905
I shall grant the local noble families
three days to present themselves.

7
00:02:15,505 --> 00:02:19,585
I intend to entrust the administration
of this city to their heirs.

8
00:02:19,665 --> 00:02:21,065
Naturally,

9
00:02:21,145 --> 00:02:23,705
you know how to deal with those
who defy our orders.

10
00:02:23,785 --> 00:02:24,985
Rest assured, Your Highness.

11
00:02:25,065 --> 00:02:26,945
Mr. Ning has provided the roster
of the noble families along our route.

12
00:02:27,025 --> 00:02:28,105
I guarantee not a single soul
shall escape.

13
00:02:28,945 --> 00:02:30,065
How many troops do we have ahead?

14
00:02:31,225 --> 00:02:32,865
The prefecture holds
about 20,000 garrisoned troops,

15
00:02:32,945 --> 00:02:34,465
and the Capital
is deploying reinforcements.

16
00:02:34,545 --> 00:02:35,665
Yet, they pose no true threat.

17
00:02:35,745 --> 00:02:36,705
Should they resist,

18
00:02:36,785 --> 00:02:39,225
we shall crush them in a battle
and march straight into the Capital.

19
00:02:39,825 --> 00:02:41,545
Furthermore, there are a few
other matters.

20
00:02:41,625 --> 00:02:42,905
Speak.

21
00:02:42,985 --> 00:02:44,465
The Grand Princess has entered
the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence alone.

22
00:02:44,545 --> 00:02:46,745
She is leveraging Your Highness's life
to demand His Lordship's retreat.

23
00:02:49,985 --> 00:02:52,505
‎RULE BY RIGHT, REALM AT PEACE

24
00:02:52,585 --> 00:02:53,985
She likely fails to realize

25
00:02:55,705 --> 00:02:57,625
how ruthless the imperial family can be.

26
00:02:57,705 --> 00:03:00,465
In the struggle for power,
even the bonds of blood

27
00:03:00,985 --> 00:03:03,465
are nothing but pawns to be sacrificed.

28
00:03:03,545 --> 00:03:06,665
Did she truly believe
she could threaten Father?

29
00:03:07,945 --> 00:03:10,185
Secret intelligence from the Capital
reports that Xie Yanfang has drafted

30
00:03:10,265 --> 00:03:11,905
an imperial edict
to condemn Chu Lan's clan,

31
00:03:11,985 --> 00:03:12,825
but has yet to issue it.

32
00:03:18,345 --> 00:03:21,945
What a ruthless man he is.

33
00:03:23,905 --> 00:03:26,025
Zhao has evidently misplaced her trust.

34
00:03:26,905 --> 00:03:28,625
The moment Chu Ling perished,

35
00:03:28,705 --> 00:03:30,785
Xie began making a blood sacrifice
of the Chu Family.

36
00:03:30,865 --> 00:03:32,785
There is another matter.

37
00:03:34,665 --> 00:03:36,785
Chu Lan and his family have vanished.

38
00:03:40,065 --> 00:03:41,345
They fled?

39
00:03:44,905 --> 00:03:46,025
That serves us well.

40
00:03:46,625 --> 00:03:50,225
Had Chu Lan remained in the Capital,
he would have become a constraint upon us.

41
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:52,945
Nonetheless,

42
00:03:53,025 --> 00:03:56,065
that idiot is far too incompetent
to have fled the Capital on his own.

43
00:03:56,865 --> 00:03:58,665
Chu Zhao must have orchestrated
this in secret.

44
00:03:59,265 --> 00:04:00,105
What then is our course?

45
00:04:01,905 --> 00:04:03,825
It is best that this leverage
remains in our hands.

46
00:04:03,905 --> 00:04:07,145
Dispatch the order
to seal all primary routes.

47
00:04:07,225 --> 00:04:09,185
Chu Lan and his family
must be apprehended.

48
00:04:09,785 --> 00:04:10,985
Understood.

49
00:04:13,985 --> 00:04:16,105
Mr. Deng, the Xiaonan Army

50
00:04:16,184 --> 00:04:17,465
is now less than a hundred li
from the Capital.

51
00:04:17,545 --> 00:04:19,345
The people along the way
are flocking to their ranks.

52
00:04:19,425 --> 00:04:21,025
I fear this might lead to trouble.

53
00:04:22,585 --> 00:04:25,305
Where is the minister dispatched
to deliver the imperial edict to Xiao Xun?

54
00:04:25,385 --> 00:04:28,105
There has been no word
from him to this day.

55
00:04:30,425 --> 00:04:32,105
Xie Yanfang's suspicion was correct.

56
00:04:32,625 --> 00:04:34,345
The dispatch riders were a ruse.

57
00:04:35,345 --> 00:04:37,585
It appears Xiao Xun intends
to use this pretext

58
00:04:37,665 --> 00:04:39,345
to force his entry into the Capital
and stage a coup.

59
00:04:39,425 --> 00:04:41,905
Xiao Xun has been disseminating
rumors along his march,

60
00:04:41,985 --> 00:04:44,625
claiming he comes to defend
His Majesty by command.

61
00:04:45,225 --> 00:04:47,785
He is clearly exploiting public sentiment

62
00:04:47,865 --> 00:04:49,825
to mislead the people.

63
00:04:49,905 --> 00:04:52,705
That is precisely my greatest fear,
that the people of the Capital

64
00:04:52,785 --> 00:04:54,185
will also be swayed by his deception.

65
00:04:54,265 --> 00:04:55,905
You must formulate a strategy
without delay, Mr. Deng.

66
00:04:55,985 --> 00:04:59,945
-If he continues deceiving the people--
-Mr. Deng!

67
00:05:00,025 --> 00:05:00,865
Mr. Deng!

68
00:05:01,385 --> 00:05:02,305
Mr. Deng.

69
00:05:03,105 --> 00:05:03,945
Please review this.

70
00:05:10,985 --> 00:05:12,745
Her Highness has entered
the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence alone,

71
00:05:12,825 --> 00:05:14,105
seeking to negotiate their surrender.

72
00:05:15,905 --> 00:05:17,385
A diversion to relieve the Capital?

73
00:05:18,785 --> 00:05:21,385
Her Highness has truly grown
far more audacious than before.

74
00:05:25,865 --> 00:05:26,865
Where is Mr. Xie?

75
00:05:26,945 --> 00:05:27,785
Mr. Deng!

76
00:05:27,865 --> 00:05:28,985
Mr. Deng!

77
00:05:30,865 --> 00:05:32,265
Mr. Deng, a matter of concern has arisen.

78
00:05:32,345 --> 00:05:34,385
Mr. Xie intends to depart
with His Majesty.

79
00:05:34,985 --> 00:05:36,665
-What?
-What? What?

80
00:05:36,745 --> 00:05:37,945
This is preposterous.

81
00:05:38,025 --> 00:05:39,465
He means to flee with His Majesty.

82
00:05:39,545 --> 00:05:41,145
Ludicrous.

83
00:05:44,385 --> 00:05:46,425
His Majesty arrives!

84
00:06:01,945 --> 00:06:03,145
Mr. Xie,

85
00:06:04,345 --> 00:06:06,425
where are you escorting His Majesty?

86
00:06:07,185 --> 00:06:10,345
I am escorting His Majesty
to lead the campaign.

87
00:06:10,945 --> 00:06:12,945
-Absolutely impermissible!
-This must not be allowed!

88
00:06:13,025 --> 00:06:15,185
-Cease this folly, Mr. Xie!
-Nonsense!

89
00:06:15,265 --> 00:06:16,345
Mr. Xie,

90
00:06:16,865 --> 00:06:19,905
are you aware of the sheer peril
of our present circumstances?

91
00:06:19,985 --> 00:06:23,945
That's the precise reason
why His Majesty must lead the army.

92
00:06:24,745 --> 00:06:28,705
The Lord of Xiaonan and his son
are his sworn enemies.

93
00:06:29,305 --> 00:06:31,345
It is only right
that His Majesty avenge his parents.

94
00:06:31,425 --> 00:06:34,145
As the one who sits on the throne,

95
00:06:34,225 --> 00:06:36,225
he must prioritize the state.

96
00:06:36,905 --> 00:06:38,545
Now that the rebels
are misleading the people,

97
00:06:38,625 --> 00:06:41,305
only the announcement
of an imperial campaign

98
00:06:41,385 --> 00:06:43,665
can lay bare their true intentions.

99
00:06:44,505 --> 00:06:46,865
Should the Lord of Xiaonan
and his son retreat,

100
00:06:47,905 --> 00:06:50,705
His Majesty's campaign shall be directed
against the Northern Desert.

101
00:06:51,425 --> 00:06:52,585
Should they refuse to withdraw,

102
00:06:53,185 --> 00:06:56,945
then His Majesty is crusading
to suppress the Xiaonan rebels.

103
00:06:58,865 --> 00:06:59,705
Mr. Deng,

104
00:07:00,425 --> 00:07:03,985
His Majesty and I
await your imperial edict.

105
00:07:19,665 --> 00:07:21,945
Now that Xie Yanfang
has entered the board,

106
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:23,305
this game

107
00:07:24,145 --> 00:07:26,345
must finally yield a victor.

108
00:07:28,345 --> 00:07:31,745
The Lord of Xiaonan always
presumed this to be his opportunity,

109
00:07:33,265 --> 00:07:34,545
yet he fails to see

110
00:07:35,905 --> 00:07:38,385
that it is Xie Yanfang's opportunity
as well.

111
00:07:54,185 --> 00:07:56,345
Mr. Chu, where are you heading
in such a rush?

112
00:07:57,145 --> 00:07:58,785
His Highness requests your presence.

113
00:08:18,425 --> 00:08:20,145
Please, have mercy.

114
00:08:20,225 --> 00:08:23,785
My family has never held any grievance
against His Highness.

115
00:08:23,865 --> 00:08:26,625
We beg you to show clemency.

116
00:08:27,785 --> 00:08:29,305
LUOCHENG

117
00:08:29,385 --> 00:08:30,585
It's been a long time since we last met.

118
00:08:31,825 --> 00:08:34,705
Mr. Chu, why do you appear so haggard?

119
00:08:34,784 --> 00:08:36,625
It seems Her Highness

120
00:08:37,144 --> 00:08:39,545
has been remiss in her care
for your family.

121
00:08:39,625 --> 00:08:42,865
Your Highness,
I was truly driven to despair.

122
00:08:43,465 --> 00:08:46,825
I had thought
I could survive by playing the fool.

123
00:08:46,905 --> 00:08:50,345
Yet the court refuses to grant me life

124
00:08:50,425 --> 00:08:52,185
because of what happened back then.

125
00:08:52,265 --> 00:08:56,225
Are you blaming me?

126
00:08:57,225 --> 00:08:58,385
I would not dare, Your Highness.

127
00:08:58,465 --> 00:09:00,785
-I swear I would never dare.
-Your Highness.

128
00:09:00,865 --> 00:09:02,225
Rest assured.

129
00:09:02,945 --> 00:09:05,345
I'm not that heartless.

130
00:09:05,425 --> 00:09:09,745
You may stay in Luocheng for now.

131
00:09:09,825 --> 00:09:12,785
Once I enter the imperial city
and present myself to His Majesty,

132
00:09:13,425 --> 00:09:15,305
I shall clear your name.

133
00:09:15,385 --> 00:09:16,825
-I appreciate it, Your Highness.
-My deepest gratitude.

134
00:09:16,905 --> 00:09:19,265
-I am profoundly grateful.
-Thank you.

135
00:09:20,625 --> 00:09:21,785
Miss Tang,

136
00:09:21,865 --> 00:09:25,105
are you willing to assist me
on behalf of your father?

137
00:09:26,465 --> 00:09:27,505
Miss Tang,

138
00:09:27,585 --> 00:09:30,225
you ingratiated yourself
with the noble families,

139
00:09:30,305 --> 00:09:31,625
keeping a sharp eye on the shifting winds,

140
00:09:32,265 --> 00:09:33,505
and the second trouble brewed,

141
00:09:34,105 --> 00:09:37,665
you didn't hesitate to take
your parents and flee the Capital.

142
00:09:38,185 --> 00:09:39,025
Am I correct?

143
00:09:39,705 --> 00:09:41,225
I did hear some news.

144
00:09:41,825 --> 00:09:43,905
Where did you get it?

145
00:09:43,985 --> 00:09:44,825
Zhao

146
00:09:45,625 --> 00:09:47,065
brought the word to me.

147
00:09:51,145 --> 00:09:53,345
You two share a remarkably deep bond.

148
00:09:53,425 --> 00:09:57,145
Her Highness could still
convey tidings to you

149
00:09:57,225 --> 00:09:58,825
from thousands of li away.

150
00:10:00,465 --> 00:10:03,025
Yet do you realize that your flight

151
00:10:03,625 --> 00:10:05,425
only serves to substantiate
the allegations

152
00:10:05,505 --> 00:10:07,185
the court leveled against you?

153
00:10:08,625 --> 00:10:11,545
If my father ascends the throne,

154
00:10:11,625 --> 00:10:12,985
I shall be the Crown Prince.

155
00:10:15,385 --> 00:10:16,345
Miss Tang,

156
00:10:18,785 --> 00:10:19,985
would you like to be the Crown Princess?

157
00:10:28,105 --> 00:10:30,785
What a masterful play
to turn the tables, Your Highness.

158
00:10:30,865 --> 00:10:31,705
‎XIAONAN PREFECTURE

159
00:10:32,225 --> 00:10:34,465
Did you truly believe
a worthless fool like Chu Lan

160
00:10:34,545 --> 00:10:36,385
could ever approach my son?

161
00:10:36,465 --> 00:10:38,185
Xiao Xun has suffered
three defeats at my hands.

162
00:10:38,905 --> 00:10:41,305
He will never hesitate to strike
when he spots an opening.

163
00:10:42,865 --> 00:10:44,625
He will take the bait, even fully aware.

164
00:10:44,705 --> 00:10:46,345
Since Your Highness knows my son so well,

165
00:10:46,425 --> 00:10:50,545
why did you sabotage
such an ideal alliance back then?

166
00:10:51,465 --> 00:10:53,225
To hunt, one must truly know the prey.

167
00:10:53,305 --> 00:10:57,025
However, I place no faith
in hollow affection.

168
00:10:57,825 --> 00:10:59,345
I trust only the blade in my hand.

169
00:11:03,305 --> 00:11:04,825
What a pity.

170
00:11:04,905 --> 00:11:08,585
A fence-sitter like Chu Lan
is unworthy of being your blade.

171
00:11:09,225 --> 00:11:12,385
You ought to know
your uncle, Your Highness.

172
00:11:12,465 --> 00:11:14,025
Even if he gained access to my son,

173
00:11:14,625 --> 00:11:19,665
a coward of his measure
could never achieve anything of note.

174
00:11:19,745 --> 00:11:22,465
How can Your Lordship be certain
I have nothing left up my sleeve?

175
00:11:23,065 --> 00:11:24,145
I am aware.

176
00:11:24,665 --> 00:11:25,945
Your cousin.

177
00:11:26,705 --> 00:11:30,665
Your Highness seems to forget
that despite your boasted detachment,

178
00:11:30,745 --> 00:11:32,705
you still lost your heart to my son.

179
00:11:33,625 --> 00:11:35,905
Let alone Chu Tang.

180
00:11:36,705 --> 00:11:39,265
Your Highness, you might as well concede.

181
00:11:44,145 --> 00:11:45,345
Your Highness.

182
00:11:47,185 --> 00:11:48,905
What… is it you require of me?

183
00:11:48,985 --> 00:11:53,665
Chu Zhao is besieging Xiaonan
with her forces.

184
00:11:53,745 --> 00:11:55,025
Therefore,

185
00:11:55,545 --> 00:11:58,785
I'd like you to persuade her,

186
00:11:59,665 --> 00:12:00,625
so as to guarantee my father's safety.

187
00:12:01,225 --> 00:12:05,705
Your Highness, how could I possibly
achieve this?

188
00:12:06,465 --> 00:12:08,145
Zhao is the Grand Princess.

189
00:12:09,385 --> 00:12:12,545
How could someone like me
ever persuade her?

190
00:12:14,225 --> 00:12:15,305
Miss Tang,

191
00:12:15,385 --> 00:12:17,185
you live as you please,

192
00:12:17,265 --> 00:12:19,265
even through hard times.

193
00:12:19,865 --> 00:12:24,225
Though Chu Zhao may be wary
and guard against you,

194
00:12:24,305 --> 00:12:28,665
I remain confident
that you know how to win her trust.

195
00:12:30,025 --> 00:12:34,785
Everyone praises Chu Zhao's valor
on the battlefield.

196
00:12:35,305 --> 00:12:36,465
But the truth is,

197
00:12:37,425 --> 00:12:38,985
maneuvering through human minds

198
00:12:39,585 --> 00:12:40,905
takes an even greater hero.

199
00:12:42,105 --> 00:12:43,305
Chu Tang,

200
00:12:43,385 --> 00:12:45,745
do you wish to stand above all others

201
00:12:46,585 --> 00:12:47,945
and be revered by the entire world?

202
00:12:53,905 --> 00:12:54,985
Your Highness.

203
00:12:57,225 --> 00:12:58,985
Will you truly marry me?

204
00:12:59,625 --> 00:13:02,945
A father's eye sees only perfection.

205
00:13:03,905 --> 00:13:06,785
There is a kind of person
who is the hardest to sway.

206
00:13:07,585 --> 00:13:08,705
Take my cousin for instance.

207
00:13:09,505 --> 00:13:13,185
She trusts nothing
she cannot hold for herself.

208
00:13:14,305 --> 00:13:15,825
She cares nothing for mere charm,

209
00:13:16,425 --> 00:13:18,905
-only for propriety.
-Propriety?

210
00:13:18,985 --> 00:13:22,665
And by what standard
does Your Highness gauge her heart?

211
00:13:23,425 --> 00:13:27,225
Besides, what my son is best at
is turning the desires of others

212
00:13:27,305 --> 00:13:29,105
into playthings in his own hands.

213
00:13:30,265 --> 00:13:33,665
You should be well aware of this.

214
00:13:34,785 --> 00:13:37,625
What truly moves people in this world

215
00:13:37,705 --> 00:13:39,905
is nothing more than profit and sincerity,

216
00:13:40,665 --> 00:13:42,665
and my son possesses both.

217
00:13:43,305 --> 00:13:44,385
Your Highness,

218
00:13:44,985 --> 00:13:47,385
how much can you offer your cousin?

219
00:13:53,865 --> 00:13:56,505
But I am not like Chu Zhao.

220
00:13:57,025 --> 00:13:59,145
She commands the frontier,
with an army at her back.

221
00:13:59,905 --> 00:14:01,385
A shared surname means nothing.

222
00:14:02,345 --> 00:14:04,665
I am of no use to your grand designs,
Your Highness.

223
00:14:04,745 --> 00:14:11,345
Do you know that the hardest thing
to fathom is not power,

224
00:14:12,385 --> 00:14:13,545
but sincerity?

225
00:14:14,345 --> 00:14:18,025
Just like
how I used to feel about Chu Zhao.

226
00:14:18,105 --> 00:14:20,305
Since Your Highness cared for her,

227
00:14:22,665 --> 00:14:25,585
why have you come to me?

228
00:14:25,665 --> 00:14:27,465
Because she does not trust me

229
00:14:28,265 --> 00:14:29,545
and even tried to kill me.

230
00:14:31,305 --> 00:14:33,065
I believe you are different from her

231
00:14:34,465 --> 00:14:37,705
and would never treat
my sincerity as dirt,

232
00:14:38,425 --> 00:14:39,425
right?

233
00:14:42,825 --> 00:14:44,465
Since I have been upfront with you,

234
00:14:45,585 --> 00:14:47,025
I will make things perfectly clear.

235
00:14:47,105 --> 00:14:51,665
Seeking to marry Zhao back then
might have been for interest,

236
00:14:51,745 --> 00:14:56,785
but seeking your help is for my father.

237
00:14:58,225 --> 00:15:00,585
My father staked everything on me

238
00:15:00,665 --> 00:15:02,345
and is now trapped in a dire situation.

239
00:15:02,425 --> 00:15:06,945
If you could write
a letter to sway Chu Zhao into retreat,

240
00:15:08,345 --> 00:15:12,145
I will never forget this kindness.

241
00:15:13,265 --> 00:15:14,145
Your Highness, there is no need for this.

242
00:15:15,385 --> 00:15:16,585
Look.

243
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:19,265
Such devotion to His Lordship.

244
00:15:19,345 --> 00:15:21,905
Not a soul alive could ever doubt it.

245
00:15:22,905 --> 00:15:26,185
Miss Tang, are you willing to help me?

246
00:15:32,865 --> 00:15:36,585
Miss Chu, this game is all but lost.

247
00:15:42,705 --> 00:15:44,905
Then I shall wager on the wild variable.

248
00:15:46,665 --> 00:15:49,305
Since Your Lordship cannot crush me yet,

249
00:15:50,185 --> 00:15:51,945
shall we play another match?

250
00:15:53,425 --> 00:15:54,785
What are we gambling on?

251
00:15:54,865 --> 00:15:57,385
Whether a simple snare of tenderness

252
00:15:57,465 --> 00:16:00,305
can shatter your son's rotten pretense.

253
00:16:07,785 --> 00:16:08,825
Your Highness,

254
00:16:10,585 --> 00:16:11,585
does it really…

255
00:16:13,225 --> 00:16:16,385
take only a fraction of this poison…

256
00:16:17,865 --> 00:16:19,545
to claim a life?

257
00:16:20,905 --> 00:16:22,265
I have lived a guarded life

258
00:16:23,025 --> 00:16:24,585
and have never killed anyone.

259
00:16:25,825 --> 00:16:26,945
I am afraid.

260
00:16:28,305 --> 00:16:30,065
There is an exception to everything.

261
00:16:32,145 --> 00:16:33,865
I believe you, Miss Tang.

262
00:16:34,465 --> 00:16:35,465
After all,

263
00:16:36,185 --> 00:16:38,785
the dagger in your sleeve
is far deadlier than this poison.

264
00:16:41,225 --> 00:16:42,265
Darling.

265
00:16:49,945 --> 00:16:51,985
What a fine dagger of meteoric iron.

266
00:16:53,945 --> 00:16:56,305
-Tell me.
-Tang.

267
00:16:56,385 --> 00:16:58,825
Should I test the blade
on your father first?

268
00:17:01,905 --> 00:17:03,065
-No!
-Your Highness,

269
00:17:03,145 --> 00:17:05,865
I am willing to kill Chu Zhao
for your sake.

270
00:17:05,944 --> 00:17:08,025
Your Highness, please spare my life.
Your Highness.

271
00:17:08,105 --> 00:17:11,785
Miss Tang, you have deceived me once.

272
00:17:12,385 --> 00:17:14,905
I will obey, Your Highness.

273
00:17:14,985 --> 00:17:15,985
Please spare my father.

274
00:17:16,065 --> 00:17:18,065
Your Highness. Please spare my life.

275
00:17:20,665 --> 00:17:21,704
-Come here.
-Father.

276
00:17:22,305 --> 00:17:23,345
Come.

277
00:17:25,944 --> 00:17:27,545
You said you would obey, didn't you?

278
00:17:28,145 --> 00:17:29,185
Get up.

279
00:17:30,385 --> 00:17:31,225
I told you to come here.

280
00:17:31,825 --> 00:17:32,825
Hold it!

281
00:17:33,945 --> 00:17:35,225
Just like this.

282
00:17:35,305 --> 00:17:36,825
-No.
-Tang.

283
00:17:36,905 --> 00:17:37,785
‎Darling.

284
00:17:37,865 --> 00:17:39,825
-Show Chu Zhao…
-Father.

285
00:17:40,425 --> 00:17:41,665
how ruthless

286
00:17:42,985 --> 00:17:43,825
her cousin can be.

287
00:17:52,465 --> 00:17:54,705
Whoever dares to move, I will kill him.

288
00:17:56,905 --> 00:17:57,985
You taught me well, Your Highness.

289
00:17:59,825 --> 00:18:03,145
Did I look the part
when I raised my blade against my father?

290
00:18:10,425 --> 00:18:12,025
Surrender now!

291
00:18:12,105 --> 00:18:13,585
PRUDENCE AND PERSISTENCE

292
00:18:13,665 --> 00:18:16,025
Take one step closer,

293
00:18:16,105 --> 00:18:17,945
and I will flay Xiao Xun alive.

294
00:18:18,465 --> 00:18:21,345
Back away, unless you want

295
00:18:21,425 --> 00:18:23,305
to watch him suffer.

296
00:18:24,745 --> 00:18:25,665
Wait.

297
00:18:26,185 --> 00:18:29,545
Tang, do you know
what you are doing right now?

298
00:18:29,625 --> 00:18:32,545
Release His Highness, now.

299
00:18:32,625 --> 00:18:35,425
Father, did you forget
he was trying to kill you just now?

300
00:18:35,505 --> 00:18:36,705
I…

301
00:18:40,025 --> 00:18:42,985
Your Highness, where is your private seal?

302
00:18:44,025 --> 00:18:45,785
In the ruyi sachet inside my sleeve.

303
00:18:48,065 --> 00:18:49,785
Brilliant, Miss Tang.

304
00:18:50,985 --> 00:18:52,665
You even kept your parents in the dark.

305
00:18:57,025 --> 00:19:00,265
Your Highness, your seal
is truly beautiful.

306
00:19:04,585 --> 00:19:06,425
Your Highness, I beg your forgiveness

307
00:19:06,945 --> 00:19:09,585
for failing to realize that their servant
was an assassin in disguise.

308
00:19:18,545 --> 00:19:20,665
I did not mean to hide it.

309
00:19:21,185 --> 00:19:23,185
My parents are of a gentle nature,

310
00:19:23,785 --> 00:19:25,385
and I feared the truth

311
00:19:26,465 --> 00:19:27,385
would terrify them.

312
00:19:29,465 --> 00:19:30,945
What did Chu Zhao promise you?

313
00:19:31,025 --> 00:19:33,265
Promises?

314
00:19:33,345 --> 00:19:34,585
We are family.

315
00:19:35,265 --> 00:19:38,225
If she falls, so will I.

316
00:19:39,185 --> 00:19:40,305
My hand

317
00:19:41,225 --> 00:19:42,505
was forced.

318
00:19:42,585 --> 00:19:44,065
It seems that, compared to Chu Zhao,

319
00:19:44,665 --> 00:19:47,665
I still haven't done enough
to make you believe

320
00:19:47,745 --> 00:19:51,945
that my promise
to make you Empress was genuine.

321
00:19:52,785 --> 00:19:55,225
You have come from a humble background.

322
00:19:55,305 --> 00:19:56,945
If I ascend the throne,

323
00:19:57,025 --> 00:19:59,785
we would be a perfect match.

324
00:19:59,865 --> 00:20:01,665
Why bow to her command?

325
00:20:03,785 --> 00:20:08,585
Or do you think yourself unfit
to be Empress

326
00:20:08,665 --> 00:20:12,945
and that the only difference
between you and her is a powerful father?

327
00:20:15,945 --> 00:20:18,465
My father is wonderful.

328
00:20:18,545 --> 00:20:22,025
Join me, and your father will become
the Emperor's father-in-law.

329
00:20:22,105 --> 00:20:24,025
I'll offer the military tally
as a betrothal gift.

330
00:20:24,105 --> 00:20:28,145
He would hold
far greater power than he does now.

331
00:20:32,505 --> 00:20:33,785
-Tang.
-Tang.

332
00:20:35,945 --> 00:20:37,105
You…!

333
00:20:39,065 --> 00:20:40,105
You wretched woman!

334
00:20:40,185 --> 00:20:42,265
Even His Lordship
never laid a finger on His Highness,

335
00:20:42,345 --> 00:20:44,465
yet you dare to…!
I will tear you to pieces!

336
00:20:45,185 --> 00:20:46,985
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

337
00:20:47,065 --> 00:20:50,265
This is the first time
I have ever struck someone,

338
00:20:50,985 --> 00:20:53,985
but I truly had no choice.

339
00:20:54,065 --> 00:20:57,265
Tang, you should have let me do it.

340
00:20:57,345 --> 00:20:59,505
I promise I would have made him remember
the pain for the rest of his life.

341
00:21:00,105 --> 00:21:02,145
I didn't do it to hurt him,

342
00:21:02,225 --> 00:21:03,865
nor was I even trying to hit him.

343
00:21:04,745 --> 00:21:05,625
What do you mean?

344
00:21:06,225 --> 00:21:07,825
I slapped him

345
00:21:08,465 --> 00:21:10,505
to burn my own bridges.

346
00:21:11,465 --> 00:21:14,785
The title His Highness promised
was far too tempting.

347
00:21:15,665 --> 00:21:16,785
I was afraid that if I kept listening,

348
00:21:17,385 --> 00:21:19,625
I would actually believe it.

349
00:21:20,305 --> 00:21:22,465
Take this to Zhao.

350
00:21:22,545 --> 00:21:23,585
If we wait any longer,

351
00:21:24,545 --> 00:21:25,745
I am afraid I might regret it.

352
00:21:26,345 --> 00:21:27,345
In your dreams.

353
00:21:27,945 --> 00:21:29,505
The guards are outside.

354
00:21:30,305 --> 00:21:32,265
You cannot even leave this room.

355
00:21:36,745 --> 00:21:40,465
Now, I've made a bitter enemy
of His Highness's right-hand man.

356
00:21:41,065 --> 00:21:42,025
I will kill you!

357
00:21:45,665 --> 00:21:48,345
Tang, what should we do now?

358
00:21:48,425 --> 00:21:51,745
Whether we bind His Highness or not,
death awaits either way.

359
00:21:51,825 --> 00:21:55,945
There is no way out.

360
00:21:56,545 --> 00:21:58,665
Father, since it has come to this,

361
00:21:58,745 --> 00:22:01,745
we must fight for a way to live
where none seems possible.

362
00:22:03,825 --> 00:22:05,625
Zhao wanted me to restrain Xiao Xun

363
00:22:06,465 --> 00:22:08,185
and then await her word.

364
00:22:09,665 --> 00:22:12,345
How certain are you of this?

365
00:22:19,145 --> 00:22:20,385
The Lord of Xiaonan has seven children,

366
00:22:21,025 --> 00:22:22,745
and Xiao Xun is merely one of them.

367
00:22:22,825 --> 00:22:24,665
To people like him,

368
00:22:24,745 --> 00:22:26,065
flesh and blood mean nothing.

369
00:22:26,665 --> 00:22:28,505
Even if Chu Tang has restrained Xiao Xun,

370
00:22:28,585 --> 00:22:30,905
it does not mean
the Lord of Xiaonan will back down.

371
00:22:35,985 --> 00:22:37,105
Xiao Xun can die,

372
00:22:37,745 --> 00:22:41,225
but the Lord of Xiaonan will not relent.

373
00:22:41,985 --> 00:22:43,265
I am aware.

374
00:22:43,345 --> 00:22:45,065
But let us wait a little longer.

375
00:22:45,145 --> 00:22:46,465
What exactly are we waiting for?

376
00:22:51,505 --> 00:22:52,345
For Xie Yanfang?

377
00:22:55,905 --> 00:22:59,585
For the news that he has brought Yu
to lead the army in person?

378
00:23:06,425 --> 00:23:07,345
You certainly place great faith in him.

379
00:23:10,465 --> 00:23:12,345
Even acting from afar,
the two of you move in perfect accord.

380
00:23:14,425 --> 00:23:17,345
I merely think
he should understand my move.

381
00:23:17,425 --> 00:23:18,705
More than just you.

382
00:23:19,785 --> 00:23:21,105
He understands everyone in the world.

383
00:23:22,465 --> 00:23:24,865
It is hardly surprising
that Xie Yanfang could earn your trust,

384
00:23:26,105 --> 00:23:27,665
Your Highness.

385
00:23:30,145 --> 00:23:33,505
-Jiu, you sound like you are…?
-I am reminding you

386
00:23:34,545 --> 00:23:36,985
that Xie Yanfang excels at claiming
the spoils from the shadows.

387
00:23:38,665 --> 00:23:40,225
His help must come

388
00:23:41,585 --> 00:23:42,745
with an ulterior motive.

389
00:23:43,905 --> 00:23:45,065
What of it?

390
00:23:47,025 --> 00:23:49,665
I have no use for Xie Yanfang's sincerity.

391
00:24:28,145 --> 00:24:31,705
XIE RESIDENCE

392
00:24:36,145 --> 00:24:37,145
Mr. Xie.

393
00:24:44,065 --> 00:24:45,345
Mr. Xie,

394
00:24:45,425 --> 00:24:47,825
the routed troops from the prefectures
who are straggling in,

395
00:24:47,905 --> 00:24:50,305
combined with the 80,000 troops
marching with the imperial expedition,

396
00:24:50,385 --> 00:24:51,505
bring our total strength to about 150,000.

397
00:24:52,225 --> 00:24:54,385
Although the Lord of Xiaonan
claims to have an army of 200,000,

398
00:24:54,465 --> 00:24:57,545
most are commoners forced
into service along the way.

399
00:24:58,145 --> 00:24:59,145
Furthermore,

400
00:24:59,225 --> 00:25:02,945
we have 30,000 of our own men
who have secretly left Gaoyang

401
00:25:03,025 --> 00:25:05,265
and can deliver a fatal blow
to the Lord of Xiaonan at any moment.

402
00:25:05,865 --> 00:25:06,985
Very well.

403
00:25:08,625 --> 00:25:12,305
Pass down the order to assemble
and prepare to move out.

404
00:25:12,385 --> 00:25:13,225
Yes.

405
00:25:14,065 --> 00:25:16,425
We must not keep Her Highness

406
00:25:17,705 --> 00:25:18,865
waiting.

407
00:25:18,945 --> 00:25:21,665
What perfect accord
between you and Chu Zhao.

408
00:25:22,545 --> 00:25:24,105
She seized Xiao Xun as a hostage,

409
00:25:24,185 --> 00:25:25,865
and you persuaded His Majesty
to lead the campaign.

410
00:25:25,945 --> 00:25:28,425
A masterful chain of stratagems.

411
00:25:29,185 --> 00:25:31,105
The Lord of Xiaonan's lifelong quest

412
00:25:31,625 --> 00:25:32,865
comes down to just one thing,

413
00:25:33,865 --> 00:25:35,865
a rightful name.

414
00:25:36,545 --> 00:25:38,305
Yet I shall ensure

415
00:25:40,905 --> 00:25:43,145
he loses the moral ground he stands on

416
00:25:44,225 --> 00:25:47,505
and the heart of his son.

417
00:25:48,505 --> 00:25:50,345
CHU

418
00:25:50,425 --> 00:25:51,745
THE CAPITAL

419
00:25:59,585 --> 00:26:01,745
XIAONAN

420
00:26:14,265 --> 00:26:16,705
Your Lordship, you do not look
particularly pleased.

421
00:26:17,785 --> 00:26:21,585
Is it because Tang managed
to capture Xiao Xun?

422
00:26:22,265 --> 00:26:26,145
I've often told my son
that to perfect the elixir,

423
00:26:26,905 --> 00:26:28,465
it is all in the timing.

424
00:26:29,585 --> 00:26:31,905
Yet he was too impatient,

425
00:26:31,985 --> 00:26:33,745
letting you gain the upper hand.

426
00:26:34,385 --> 00:26:36,625
But do you truly believe

427
00:26:37,945 --> 00:26:39,105
you have won?

428
00:26:39,705 --> 00:26:40,905
With Xiao Xun captured,

429
00:26:41,425 --> 00:26:43,625
his life is in our hands.

430
00:26:45,025 --> 00:26:48,225
I have one wife and three concubines,

431
00:26:48,745 --> 00:26:50,625
with seven children in total.

432
00:26:51,425 --> 00:26:56,185
So Your Lordship means
Xiao Xun's survival is of no consequence?

433
00:26:57,985 --> 00:27:00,185
Xun is a devoted son.

434
00:27:00,945 --> 00:27:04,385
So even if it costs him his life,

435
00:27:05,145 --> 00:27:08,905
he would never allow anyone
to use it as leverage against his father.

436
00:27:09,985 --> 00:27:11,505
After I ascend the throne,

437
00:27:11,585 --> 00:27:13,185
I will honor him as Crown Prince.

438
00:27:13,265 --> 00:27:15,665
How about I name you Crown Princess,

439
00:27:15,745 --> 00:27:16,945
so you may keep him company
in the afterlife?

440
00:27:21,625 --> 00:27:22,545
I dare you.

441
00:27:29,825 --> 00:27:30,825
It's true

442
00:27:31,505 --> 00:27:33,225
blood holds no sway in the palace.

443
00:27:33,305 --> 00:27:36,025
Your Highness also waded through blood

444
00:27:36,105 --> 00:27:38,985
in the coup to reach this position.

445
00:27:39,785 --> 00:27:42,385
Do you think that capturing Xun

446
00:27:42,465 --> 00:27:44,945
would make me hesitate?

447
00:27:55,585 --> 00:27:58,865
Since Your Lordship
disregards even your son's life,

448
00:27:59,705 --> 00:28:02,185
you must care even less
about being labeled a traitorous rebel.

449
00:28:03,505 --> 00:28:04,665
I received word

450
00:28:04,745 --> 00:28:07,145
that His Majesty
is about to lead the army in person.

451
00:28:07,665 --> 00:28:08,785
Can Your Lordship guess

452
00:28:09,425 --> 00:28:11,585
whether the imperial expedition
is targeting the Northern Desert

453
00:28:11,665 --> 00:28:14,105
or Xiaonan Prefecture?

454
00:28:15,225 --> 00:28:19,945
If it is the latter, this treason
can never be absolved.

455
00:28:20,825 --> 00:28:22,025
I promise you

456
00:28:22,105 --> 00:28:24,105
that if you withdraw your troops now,

457
00:28:24,185 --> 00:28:25,825
I can ensure you remain unscathed.

458
00:28:30,745 --> 00:28:32,665
Should you not be begging me

459
00:28:32,745 --> 00:28:35,105
to spare that boy's life
when I ascend the throne?

460
00:28:35,185 --> 00:28:37,625
Or if you submit to me now,

461
00:28:37,705 --> 00:28:38,985
I can spare your life as well.

462
00:28:40,825 --> 00:28:41,705
Xiao Hong,

463
00:28:42,905 --> 00:28:44,665
His Majesty and I have no need
for your mercy,

464
00:28:44,745 --> 00:28:46,385
nor will you have the chance
to face His Majesty in battle.

465
00:28:48,185 --> 00:28:49,465
With Xiao Xun captured,

466
00:28:50,065 --> 00:28:52,625
the Xiaonan forces in the Capital
are left without a head,

467
00:28:52,705 --> 00:28:53,825
destined to crumble at the first strike.

468
00:28:54,425 --> 00:28:56,305
The day His Majesty's cavalry
crushes Xiaonan Prefecture,

469
00:28:56,385 --> 00:28:58,705
your treacherous correspondence
with the Northern Desert

470
00:28:58,785 --> 00:29:00,225
will be posted on every city gate.

471
00:29:00,945 --> 00:29:01,785
When the time comes,

472
00:29:01,865 --> 00:29:03,665
the frontier troops of Yunzhong
will be waiting to sever

473
00:29:03,745 --> 00:29:05,265
every head of your clan.

474
00:29:05,865 --> 00:29:10,145
I will have them all displayed,
one by one, atop the city gates,

475
00:29:10,225 --> 00:29:11,065
for all to witness.

476
00:29:11,985 --> 00:29:14,425
The court historians will write
as I command.

477
00:29:14,505 --> 00:29:18,065
The traitor Xiao Hong
is condemned for treason.

478
00:29:18,145 --> 00:29:18,985
His clan shall be exterminated.

479
00:29:20,225 --> 00:29:22,065
Every life
in the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence

480
00:29:22,145 --> 00:29:24,305
and every blade that falls on them

481
00:29:24,385 --> 00:29:26,545
serve to atone for your infamy.

482
00:29:27,665 --> 00:29:31,505
Did you believe
I captured Xiao Xun to threaten you?

483
00:29:32,025 --> 00:29:35,465
I want you to know
I can take his head at any moment.

484
00:29:36,065 --> 00:29:37,185
If you persist in your defiance,

485
00:29:37,265 --> 00:29:39,665
I will ensure that there is
not a single soul left

486
00:29:40,185 --> 00:29:41,865
to shed a tear for the Xiao Clan.

487
00:29:48,305 --> 00:29:49,905
Even with perfect timing,

488
00:29:51,145 --> 00:29:52,665
you still need a spark to ignite it.

489
00:29:53,585 --> 00:29:54,705
Xiao Hong,

490
00:29:55,705 --> 00:29:57,625
as long as I draw breath,

491
00:29:58,145 --> 00:30:01,065
Xiao Clan can forget
about touching the throne.

492
00:30:12,385 --> 00:30:13,385
Your Lordship,

493
00:30:14,185 --> 00:30:16,105
standing for too long harms your bad leg.

494
00:30:16,625 --> 00:30:18,865
Why don't you take a seat and talk?

495
00:30:20,505 --> 00:30:21,745
You fool,

496
00:30:25,425 --> 00:30:28,985
do you truly think
you are the one to end this game?

497
00:30:29,585 --> 00:30:31,345
What I want is simple.

498
00:30:31,865 --> 00:30:34,705
Withdraw your troops
and leave Xiao Xun as a hostage.

499
00:30:35,865 --> 00:30:39,465
Your Lordship
would still hold dominion over Xiaonan.

500
00:30:39,545 --> 00:30:44,425
It's a pity the world doesn't bend
to your will alone.

501
00:30:45,745 --> 00:30:48,145
As things stand,
even if I were willing to retreat,

502
00:30:49,865 --> 00:30:51,985
someone else would not allow it.

503
00:30:52,545 --> 00:30:56,505
Xie Yanfang has brought His Majesty
to the front lines.

504
00:30:56,585 --> 00:30:59,705
The imperial expedition
is acclaimed by all,

505
00:30:59,785 --> 00:31:02,865
its momentum like a rising tide.

506
00:31:03,465 --> 00:31:05,025
After all your planning,

507
00:31:05,625 --> 00:31:08,385
are you truly resigned
to letting another reap the rewards?

508
00:31:09,305 --> 00:31:10,585
I only know

509
00:31:11,385 --> 00:31:13,665
that Your Lordship must accept my terms.

510
00:31:20,105 --> 00:31:22,025
Your Lordship broke your leg
in a fall at seven,

511
00:31:22,625 --> 00:31:25,705
yet the late Emperor met that frailty
with nothing but disdain.

512
00:31:26,425 --> 00:31:28,025
Having survived until today,

513
00:31:28,545 --> 00:31:31,465
are you truly content to die at the hands
of a mere woman like me?

514
00:31:32,065 --> 00:31:33,025
You…

515
00:31:34,305 --> 00:31:35,785
Her Highness considers your situation

516
00:31:36,385 --> 00:31:39,185
and has specially prepared
a letter of surrender for Your Lordship.

517
00:31:40,185 --> 00:31:41,305
The moment Your Lordship
affixes your seal,

518
00:31:41,385 --> 00:31:43,385
it will be dispatched to the Capital.

519
00:31:44,865 --> 00:31:50,105
If I can surrender my son
to suppress this rebellion,

520
00:31:51,265 --> 00:31:53,585
what can you possibly offer me?

521
00:31:57,105 --> 00:31:59,225
How does the title

522
00:31:59,305 --> 00:32:01,385
of the Prince of State sound
to Your Lordship?

523
00:32:35,065 --> 00:32:37,625
The first sentence
in Her Highness's letter

524
00:32:38,305 --> 00:32:40,065
certainly gets straight to the point.

525
00:32:43,265 --> 00:32:45,305
This war must not come to pass.

526
00:32:48,105 --> 00:32:49,665
Her Highness states

527
00:32:50,185 --> 00:32:52,505
she has captured the heir
to the Lord of Xiaonan, Xiao Xun,

528
00:32:52,585 --> 00:32:55,985
and by holding the life
of the Xiao Clan over his head,

529
00:32:56,065 --> 00:32:57,745
she has forced the Lord
to withdraw his troops.

530
00:32:58,665 --> 00:33:01,825
She only asks the imperial court
to pardon their sins,

531
00:33:02,425 --> 00:33:04,865
requiring only that Xiao Xun
enter the Capital as a hostage

532
00:33:05,625 --> 00:33:07,825
and that the Prince of Xiaonan
be granted the title of Prince of State.

533
00:33:09,625 --> 00:33:12,425
Is Her Highness being too lenient?

534
00:33:13,025 --> 00:33:14,505
Not punishing them is one thing,

535
00:33:14,585 --> 00:33:16,345
but to grant him an even higher title?

536
00:33:17,105 --> 00:33:19,505
Absurd. Treason is a grave crime.

537
00:33:19,585 --> 00:33:20,945
How could it be so easily pardoned?

538
00:33:21,025 --> 00:33:23,625
In my view,
the Lord of Xiaonan should return

539
00:33:23,705 --> 00:33:26,305
to the Capital to beg for forgiveness.

540
00:33:27,185 --> 00:33:28,465
-Right.
-Yes.

541
00:33:29,065 --> 00:33:30,905
Her Highness argues in her letter,

542
00:33:31,425 --> 00:33:33,025
"While the court's forces are strong,

543
00:33:33,625 --> 00:33:35,665
the Northern Desert is restless.

544
00:33:36,425 --> 00:33:38,705
The Lord of Xiaonan
has long harbored treasonous designs.

545
00:33:39,305 --> 00:33:40,465
If the conflict drags on,

546
00:33:40,545 --> 00:33:42,745
I fear the state will be plunged
into chaos for decades.

547
00:33:42,825 --> 00:33:45,105
The Lord of Xiaonan covets the throne
but lacks the spine for it.

548
00:33:45,185 --> 00:33:46,705
If his edge is blunted,

549
00:33:46,785 --> 00:33:48,545
he will surely tread with extreme caution.

550
00:33:48,625 --> 00:33:53,905
Therefore, the court can subdue
the enemy without a war."

551
00:33:53,985 --> 00:33:55,505
A victory without a war is like

552
00:33:55,585 --> 00:33:58,025
merits going unnoticed.

553
00:33:58,105 --> 00:34:00,345
Even if we are willing, would Mr. Xie be?

554
00:34:00,945 --> 00:34:03,225
Now that His Majesty
has assembled the forces

555
00:34:03,305 --> 00:34:04,745
for an imperial expedition,

556
00:34:05,345 --> 00:34:07,705
negotiating peace secretly
with the Lord of Xiaonan

557
00:34:08,304 --> 00:34:10,185
would bring unimaginable infamy upon us.

558
00:34:12,344 --> 00:34:14,585
<i>Mr. Deng, what gives you such support,</i>

559
00:34:14,665 --> 00:34:16,905
<i>enough to rival the Xie Clan,</i>

560
00:34:16,985 --> 00:34:18,585
<i>is the late Emperor's dying wish</i>

561
00:34:18,665 --> 00:34:20,385
<i>to place the Imperial Seal in your hands.</i>

562
00:34:21,505 --> 00:34:23,344
<i>It is not you they follow,</i>

563
00:34:23,425 --> 00:34:25,385
<i>but the power behind you.</i>

564
00:34:26,585 --> 00:34:28,625
<i>In war and peace,</i>
<i>it is the generals who hold sway.</i>

565
00:34:28,705 --> 00:34:31,385
<i>A commander in the field</i>
<i>need not always heed the Emperor's orders.</i>

566
00:34:32,225 --> 00:34:34,105
<i>If even an imperial command</i>
<i>can be refused,</i>

567
00:34:34,185 --> 00:34:36,385
<i>what then of a regent's authority?</i>

568
00:34:37,705 --> 00:34:38,744
<i>So, Mr. Deng,</i>

569
00:34:39,545 --> 00:34:41,824
<i>do you intend to serve in an age of chaos</i>

570
00:34:41,905 --> 00:34:43,824
<i>or an age of prosperity?</i>

571
00:34:53,945 --> 00:34:55,145
Draft the decree.

572
00:34:56,985 --> 00:34:58,105
Yes.

573
00:35:04,945 --> 00:35:08,425
LUOCHENG

574
00:35:08,505 --> 00:35:09,985
The Northern Desert is encroaching,

575
00:35:10,065 --> 00:35:11,705
and His Majesty
is leading the army in person.

576
00:35:11,785 --> 00:35:13,265
The Lord of Xiaonan
intended to dispatch troops

577
00:35:13,345 --> 00:35:14,345
to garrison the Capital.

578
00:35:15,185 --> 00:35:17,225
However, Xiao Xun, in…

579
00:35:19,745 --> 00:35:20,825
his obstinate defiance,

580
00:35:20,905 --> 00:35:22,705
harbored treasonous designs.

581
00:35:22,785 --> 00:35:25,585
By commanding Xiao Xun
to the Capital to face justice,

582
00:35:25,665 --> 00:35:27,305
the Prince of Xiaonan
has placed duty above blood,

583
00:35:27,385 --> 00:35:28,425
a loyalty most commendable.

584
00:35:28,505 --> 00:35:31,505
The title of Prince of State
is hereby conferred upon him,

585
00:35:31,585 --> 00:35:33,305
in recognition of his fealty.

586
00:35:45,305 --> 00:35:47,065
Your Highness, please rise.

587
00:35:57,385 --> 00:36:01,585
Father has cast me aside.

588
00:36:02,105 --> 00:36:03,985
His Lordship had no other choices.

589
00:36:04,065 --> 00:36:06,265
Please do not hold a grudge
against His Lordship.

590
00:36:07,865 --> 00:36:09,585
Why would I?

591
00:36:12,425 --> 00:36:13,585
A sacrificed piece

592
00:36:14,705 --> 00:36:16,425
must know its place.

593
00:36:17,025 --> 00:36:19,505
Chu Zhao has set an inescapable trap.

594
00:36:20,025 --> 00:36:21,145
Be careful on your way

595
00:36:22,425 --> 00:36:23,865
to the Capital, Your Highness.

596
00:36:30,225 --> 00:36:31,585
Chu Zhao.

597
00:36:48,585 --> 00:36:50,025
Are you certain it is safe now?

598
00:36:50,105 --> 00:36:51,825
Rest assured. It has been safe
for some time.

599
00:36:52,665 --> 00:36:53,625
‎Okay.

600
00:36:55,425 --> 00:36:57,905
Mr. Chu, there is still
a grand undertaking waiting for you.

601
00:36:58,745 --> 00:37:00,625
Grand undertaking? What is that?

602
00:37:00,705 --> 00:37:01,905
Her Highness says

603
00:37:01,985 --> 00:37:04,505
you are to accompany
Xiao Xun back to the Capital.

604
00:37:04,585 --> 00:37:06,305
Having achieved such a monumental success,

605
00:37:06,385 --> 00:37:08,625
you should go and see His Majesty
to receive your rewards.

606
00:37:09,225 --> 00:37:11,225
That's right. We did render our service.

607
00:37:11,305 --> 00:37:12,865
We deserve a reward.

608
00:37:13,785 --> 00:37:15,625
Go. Let's claim it.

609
00:37:16,705 --> 00:37:18,665
Darling, do you truly wish to go?

610
00:37:18,745 --> 00:37:20,745
Could this be another errand
to our deaths?

611
00:37:21,625 --> 00:37:22,465
Wait.

612
00:37:22,545 --> 00:37:25,025
We risked our lives for this.

613
00:37:25,105 --> 00:37:26,145
It is real.

614
00:37:26,225 --> 00:37:28,985
Father, remember to ask His Majesty
for plenty of rewards.

615
00:37:29,505 --> 00:37:30,625
After all,

616
00:37:31,545 --> 00:37:34,145
I did give up a chance
to marry into power.

617
00:37:34,225 --> 00:37:35,585
That's for sure.

618
00:37:35,665 --> 00:37:37,185
-Let's go claim our rewards.
-Alright.

619
00:37:37,265 --> 00:37:37,905
EARNEST AND MODEST

620
00:37:37,985 --> 00:37:39,705
-Hold on tight.
-Mother, easy.

621
00:37:39,785 --> 00:37:40,665
Hurry.

622
00:37:41,185 --> 00:37:41,905
‎TAIJI HALL

623
00:37:41,985 --> 00:37:45,905
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

624
00:37:45,985 --> 00:37:46,985
‎DILIGENT AND VIRTUOUS

625
00:37:47,065 --> 00:37:48,345
You may rise.

626
00:37:48,425 --> 00:37:50,585
-Thank you, Your Majesty.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

627
00:37:52,465 --> 00:37:54,945
Mr. Deng, I appreciate your tireless
dedication to affairs of state.

628
00:37:55,745 --> 00:37:59,145
Guarding the state for Your Majesty
is my duty.

629
00:37:59,745 --> 00:38:00,945
With you presiding over the court,

630
00:38:01,465 --> 00:38:03,065
I was able to march with peace of mind.

631
00:38:03,585 --> 00:38:05,065
You have earned great merit.

632
00:38:10,265 --> 00:38:13,385
Your Majesty, where is Mr. Xie?

633
00:38:13,465 --> 00:38:16,105
He offered to remain in Xiaonan Prefecture
to handle the aftermath.

634
00:38:16,625 --> 00:38:19,065
He will return to the Capital
once the situation is settled.

635
00:38:20,265 --> 00:38:21,545
Given the gravity of the matter,

636
00:38:22,065 --> 00:38:25,345
would it be wise to leave it
entirely to Mr. Xie?

637
00:38:25,425 --> 00:38:27,465
He is my own flesh and blood.

638
00:38:27,985 --> 00:38:29,185
How could it not be appropriate?

639
00:38:30,145 --> 00:38:31,425
Do you doubt

640
00:38:31,505 --> 00:38:33,945
his ability to manage
the affairs of Xiaonan Prefecture?

641
00:38:36,025 --> 00:38:37,585
I would not dare to speak recklessly.

642
00:38:37,665 --> 00:38:40,785
Everything is at
Your Majesty's discretion.

643
00:38:41,505 --> 00:38:43,705
The imperial uncle's carriage
has entered the city.

644
00:38:43,785 --> 00:38:46,945
I leave the rest to your discretion.

645
00:38:47,025 --> 00:38:49,505
Yes, Your Majesty.

646
00:38:55,505 --> 00:38:59,465
THE CAPITAL

647
00:39:02,585 --> 00:39:04,265
Send His Highness to the side residence.

648
00:39:04,785 --> 00:39:05,825
Assign more guards

649
00:39:05,905 --> 00:39:08,065
and ensure His Highness is well cared for.

650
00:39:08,145 --> 00:39:09,145
Yes.

651
00:39:39,945 --> 00:39:41,505
Long live His Majesty!

652
00:39:41,585 --> 00:39:43,865
The rebels of Xiaonan Prefecture
are repelled,

653
00:39:43,945 --> 00:39:48,025
and the State of Chu
is preserved for eternity!

654
00:39:48,105 --> 00:39:50,185
"For eternity"?

655
00:39:52,465 --> 00:39:54,105
They actually treat Your Highness
as a prisoner.

656
00:39:54,985 --> 00:39:56,385
A defeated enemy

657
00:39:57,225 --> 00:39:58,465
deserves no courtesies.

658
00:39:59,345 --> 00:40:01,425
It should have been Your Highness
entering the city in triumph.

659
00:40:01,505 --> 00:40:03,225
Chu Zhao used you as a hostage,

660
00:40:03,305 --> 00:40:04,905
and His Lordship had no choice
but to retreat his troops,

661
00:40:04,985 --> 00:40:05,865
wasting all his efforts.

662
00:40:06,865 --> 00:40:10,385
Did Father call back his troops
for my sake

663
00:40:10,465 --> 00:40:11,825
or for his reputation?

664
00:40:12,865 --> 00:40:15,025
We both know the answer.

665
00:40:15,825 --> 00:40:16,945
But it doesn't matter.

666
00:40:17,745 --> 00:40:19,465
Even if my father has no regard for me,

667
00:40:19,545 --> 00:40:22,385
I still have to play the dutiful son,
don't I?

668
00:40:22,985 --> 00:40:23,945
Your Highness.

669
00:40:24,465 --> 00:40:25,665
No need for comfort.

670
00:40:26,865 --> 00:40:29,145
Chu Zhao's scheme was brilliant.

671
00:40:30,065 --> 00:40:32,025
First, she used the Longwei Army
to threaten Father

672
00:40:32,625 --> 00:40:33,665
into hesitation,

673
00:40:34,305 --> 00:40:35,945
then she joined forces with Xie Yanfang

674
00:40:36,625 --> 00:40:40,385
to deceive my nephew
into leading an imperial expedition.

675
00:40:41,545 --> 00:40:43,865
Father has been so cautious

676
00:40:44,905 --> 00:40:46,585
that he would not risk sending troops.

677
00:40:47,385 --> 00:40:48,345
How could His Lordship do this?

678
00:40:48,945 --> 00:40:50,265
Father has valued

679
00:40:50,865 --> 00:40:53,385
a rightful name
above all else his entire life.

680
00:40:54,545 --> 00:40:55,865
Yet,

681
00:40:55,945 --> 00:40:59,985
he was nearly branded a traitor
by Chu Zhao and Xie Yanfang,

682
00:41:02,345 --> 00:41:03,745
so he had to abandon me.

683
00:41:06,385 --> 00:41:07,665
My mistake

684
00:41:09,545 --> 00:41:11,625
was underestimating Chu Zhao again.

685
00:41:12,505 --> 00:41:13,425
I never thought

686
00:41:14,025 --> 00:41:16,425
she was capable of such ruthlessness,

687
00:41:17,745 --> 00:41:19,465
wagering me over Xiaonan Prefecture

688
00:41:20,545 --> 00:41:21,825
and Xiaonan Prefecture

689
00:41:23,345 --> 00:41:25,625
over the will of the people.

690
00:41:28,705 --> 00:41:30,145
If Your Highness wishes to leave,

691
00:41:30,225 --> 00:41:31,625
I will risk my life
to escort you out of the city.

692
00:41:32,505 --> 00:41:33,945
Why the rush?

693
00:41:36,265 --> 00:41:38,145
Since we are back in the Capital,

694
00:41:39,585 --> 00:41:41,465
I might as well play out

695
00:41:42,185 --> 00:41:44,585
the rest of this game with Chu Zhao.

696
00:41:46,985 --> 00:41:50,185
FERRYMAN’S LODGE

